
The CESimulation souftware is at:
/path_to/CESimulation

CESimulation software install dir at:
/path_to/CEInstall

Change the  CRYSTALEYE_SYS path in /path_to/CESimulation/ce-setup.sh with the /path_to/CEInstall

To Build (in the build_dir):
/path_to/build_dir
cmake -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path_to/CEInstall /path_to/CESimulation

make 
make install

To initialize the software:
./path_to/CEInstall/bin/ce-setup.sh

To run the simulation:
./CESimu
(help dialog will appear for running the simualtion)
